{
    "title": "DIY Paper Doll",
    "description": "DIY Paper Doll is a sweet doll maker, dress-up, fashion game based on the classic paper arts and crafts and sticker games that we all love and remember. In this adorable teen game, you get to be the doll designer of your own yoyo doll life! In DIY Paper Doll, customize your dolls by choosing from the wide variety of clothing options, accessories, hair styles, and makeup looks. Dress up doll characters to interact with and enter unique stories and plots. This doll makeover challenge allows you to craft your own custom magic princess yoyo doll. So many cute outfits to choose from like tie dye dresses & doll designer brands, shoes, & makeup. Be a paper princess maker and craft your very own doll makeover. Design the perfect dreamhouse for your dolly.\r\n\r\nDIY Paper Doll lets you become a queen of fashion and dress up your custom magic princess chibi dolls. Unleash your imagination and become an expert sweet doll maker. Upgrade your creative skills in this doll makeover teen game! My style selection, my story. \r\n\r\n> Customize your sweet doll with 1000+ items \r\n> Unlock fashion collections so your doll\u2019s style stays on trend\r\n> Personalize your doll\u2019s outfit, skin tone, eye color, hairstyle, & makeup \r\n> Create diary entries with photos of your dolls in different environments and outfits\r\n> And so much more!\r\n\r\nMake a perfect dreamhouse for your paper princess, in one of the adorable dress up doll games. Become a doll designer and create stunning outfits for your sweet paper princess. Dress up your lovable dolly in the latest fashion trends and create unforgettable looks. Let the makeover fun begin!\r\n\r\nTo opt out of CrazyLabs sales of personal information as a California resident, please visit our Privacy Policy: https://www.crazylabs.com/apps-privacy-policy/",
    "descriptionHTML": "DIY Paper Doll is a sweet doll maker, dress-up, fashion game based on the classic paper arts and crafts and sticker games that we all love and remember. In this adorable teen game, you get to be the doll designer of your own yoyo doll life! In DIY Paper Doll, customize your dolls by choosing from the wide variety of clothing options, accessories, hair styles, and makeup looks. Dress up doll characters to interact with and enter unique stories and plots. This doll makeover challenge allows you to craft your own custom magic princess yoyo doll. So many cute outfits to choose from like tie dye dresses &amp; doll designer brands, shoes, &amp; makeup. Be a paper princess maker and craft your very own doll makeover. Design the perfect dreamhouse for your dolly.<br><br>DIY Paper Doll lets you become a queen of fashion and dress up your custom magic princess chibi dolls. Unleash your imagination and become an expert sweet doll maker. Upgrade your creative skills in this doll makeover teen game! My style selection, my story. <br><br>&gt; Customize your sweet doll with 1000+ items <br>&gt; Unlock fashion collections so your doll\u2019s style stays on trend<br>&gt; Personalize your doll\u2019s outfit, skin tone, eye color, hairstyle, &amp; makeup <br>&gt; Create diary entries with photos of your dolls in different environments and outfits<br>&gt; And so much more!<br><br>Make a perfect dreamhouse for your paper princess, in one of the adorable dress up doll games. Become a doll designer and create stunning outfits for your sweet paper princess. Dress up your lovable dolly in the latest fashion trends and create unforgettable looks. Let the makeover fun begin!<br><br>To opt out of CrazyLabs sales of personal information as a California resident, please visit our Privacy Policy: https://www.crazylabs.com/apps-privacy-policy/",
